    "K_t": "Evidence:\n[1] Ronald T. Y. Moon (born September 4, 1940) was the Chief Justice of the Hawaii State Supreme Court in Honolulu, Hawaii.\n[2] Fidelma O'Kelly Macken (born 1942) is a retired judge of the Supreme Court of Ireland.\n[3] Aharon Barak (Hebrew: אהרן ברק‎ , born Aharon Brick, 16 September 1936) is a Professor of Law at the Interdisciplinary Center in Herzliya and a lecturer in law at the Hebrew University of Jerusalem, the Yale Law School, Central European University, Georgetown University Law Center, and the University of Toronto Faculty of Law.\n[4] Her Master’s thesis, advocating the establishment of a supreme court, was used as a guideline by Virgin Islands lawmakers to create the Supreme Court of the Virgin Islands in 2004.\n\nNotes:\n[bridge] The Kahan Commission included a Supreme Court judge born on 16 September 1936."
